    "text": "<p>An ideal cell of emf&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> is connected in circuit shown in figure. Each resistance is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math>. The potential difference (in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>) across the capacitor when it is fully charged is _____________</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0225_e09ecf3cbeae.png\" style=\"width: 231px; height: 183px;\" />&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>"
